---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Fresh Fold Delivery Pass | Laundry Delivery Membership"
	description="Fresh Fold Delivery Pass removes the base dispatch fee and gives member mileage pricing for frequent laundry pickup and delivery customers."
	canonicalPath="/delivery-pass"
>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="container">
			<p class="eyebrow">Separate delivery add-on</p>
			<h1>Fresh Fold Delivery Pass</h1>
			<p>Use Fresh Fold often? Add Delivery Pass to remove the base dispatch fee and receive member mileage pricing.</p>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a href="/book-pickup" class="btn btn-primary">Add Delivery Pass</a>
				<a href="/pricing" class="btn btn-secondary">View Pricing</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="pass-summary">
		<div class="container summary-grid">
			<div class="price-card">
				<h2>$7.99<span>/month</span></h2>
				<p>Delivery Pass is a separate monthly add-on. It is not the same as a laundry subscription.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rules-card">
				<h2>What It Does</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>$0 base dispatch fee</li>
					<li>$1.50 per round-trip mile introductory rate for first 3 months</li>
					<li>$1.70 per round-trip mile after the intro period</li>
					<li>Route priority where available</li>
					<li>Optional driver tipping</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="details">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Delivery Pass Does Not Mean Unlimited Free Delivery</h2>
			<p>It only removes the base dispatch fee and gives member mileage pricing. Mileage, route availability, service timing, weather, demand, add-ons, specialty items, tips, missed pickup fees, and redelivery fees remain separate when applicable.</p>
			<div class="table-responsive">
				<table>
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th>Customer Type</th>
							<th>Base Dispatch Fee</th>
							<th>Mileage Rate</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr>
							<td>One-Time Customer</td>
							<td>$3.80</td>
							<td>$1.75 per round-trip mile</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td>Subscriber Without Delivery Pass</td>
							<td>$2.50</td>
							<td>$1.70 per round-trip mile</td>
						</tr>
						<tr class="featured-row">
							<td>Delivery Pass Member</td>
							<td>$0.00</td>
							<td>$1.50 intro / $1.70 standard per round-trip mile</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="formula">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>How Delivery Is Calculated</h2>
			<div class="formula-grid">
				<div>
					<h3>1. Round-trip miles</h3>
					<p>Round-trip miles = one-way miles x 2.</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>2. Mileage fee</h3>
					<p>Mileage fee = round-trip miles x mileage rate.</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>3. Delivery fee</h3>
					<p>Delivery fee = base dispatch fee + mileage fee + route, weather, or demand adjustments.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Ready to lower frequent delivery costs?</h2>
			<p>Add Delivery Pass with a pickup request, or compare laundry subscriptions first.</p>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a href="/book-pickup" class="btn btn-primary">Book Pickup</a>
				<a href="/subscriptions" class="btn btn-secondary">Compare Subscriptions</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4f8 0%, #e8f2f8 100%);
		padding: 70px 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		color: #00a0c6;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin-bottom: 15px;
	}

	.hero p {
		color: #555;
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto 28px;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 15px;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.pass-summary,
	.details,
	.formula {
		padding: 60px 0;
	}

	.summary-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 1fr) minmax(280px, 2fr);
		gap: 28px;
	}

	.price-card,
	.rules-card {
		background: white;
		border: 1px solid #d8e8ef;
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 30px;
		box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
	}

	.price-card h2 {
		color: #00a0c6;
		font-size: 2.6rem;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.price-card span {
		color: #666;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.rules-card h2,
	.details h2,
	.formula h2 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	.rules-card ul {
		margin-left: 20px;
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.details {
		background: #f9f9f9;
	}

	.details p {
		color: #555;
		max-width: 900px;
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
	}

	.table-responsive {
		overflow-x: auto;
	}

	table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		background: white;
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
	}

	th,
	td {
		padding: 15px;
		text-align: left;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
	}

	th {
		background-color: #001f3f;
		color: white;
	}

	.featured-row {
		background: #f0f4f8;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.formula-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.formula-grid div {
		background: white;
		border: 1px solid #d8e8ef;
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 24px;
	}

	.formula-grid h3 {
		color: #001f3f;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.formula-grid p {
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.cta {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0066a1 0%, #00a0c6 100%);
		color: white;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 70px 0;
	}

	.cta h2 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.cta p {
		margin-bottom: 24px;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.summary-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.hero-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		th,
		td {
			padding: 10px;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}
	}
</style>
